g=Text("Both dengue and chikungunya are spread mainly by aedes aegypti and aedes albopictus mosquitoes, which bite mostly during the day. WHO notes that preventing mosquito bites and eliminating breeding sites are the main ways to reduce transmission for both infections [11].","body")
