n=Text("The biggest clinical clue is that dengueueue tends to feature more prominent headache, eye, pain, vomiting and potential bleeding, while chikungunya is more strongly associated with intense, prolonged prolonged joint pain and swelling. WHO also notes that chikungunya joint pain can last weeks, months, or even some patients.","body")
